WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,920
He had low blood sugar today and almost fainted

2
00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:03,120
His blood will be deducted from his meal

3
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:04,160
I'll take him to work

4
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:05,160
Don't chase him away

5
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:06,480
Came just in time

6
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:08,000
Separate the fat from the meat

7
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,120
Divide it cleanly. If you are full at night, just use this Xianqingsong

8
00:00:11,120 --> 00:00:13,440
There's some pig skin over there that needs to be scraped off, don't you mind?

9
00:00:13,440 --> 00:00:14,400
I just didn't expect it

10
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:16,840
It’s really just working in exchange for food, what do you think?

11
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:19,640
At the very least, the rule here is to make it clear that your contribution is not enough.

12
00:00:19,640 --> 00:00:21,680
I won’t tell you that your contribution is not enough after finishing the work.

13
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:22,800
Give me less publicity

14
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:25,020
If you don't do well today, you'll be deducted the same

15
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:33,700
That's better than not knowing the standards, right?

16
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:37,100
They didn't work today. No idiots. I can sing while you work.

17
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:38,340
I'm responsible for making the atmosphere less stuffy

18
00:00:38,340 --> 00:00:39,740
At least it's better than sitting around waiting for food

19
00:00:39,740 --> 00:00:42,930
Then I tie the knot to fix the row.

20
00:00:42,930 --> 00:00:44,610
Today I will tie you until you can’t find any faults
